  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt = int(input())\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    \r\n    a.sort(reverse = True)\r\n    \r\n    xp = [0]*((3*n) + 1)\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(3*n):\r\n        xp[i+1] = xp[i] + a[i]\r\n        \r\n    bb = 0\r\n    for p in range(n+1):\r\n        l,h = 0, n-p\r\n        \r\n        while(l<h):\r\n            mid = (l+h)//2\r\n            \r\n            if(a[p + (2*mid)] + a[p + 2*mid+1] - 3*a[3*n - 2*p - mid - 1] > 0):\r\n                l = mid + 1\r\n            else:\r\n                h = mid \r\n                \r\n        q = l \r\n    \r\n        val = 2*xp[p] + xp[p+2*q] + 3*xp[3*n - 2*p -q]\r\n        \r\n        if val > bb:\r\n            bb = val \r\n    \r\n    print(bb)",
